@unlockby:589@
A word of gory darkness that causes your target to bleed for $o1 Shadow damage over $d.

This damage is increased by 8%, up to a maximum of 40%, for each other bleed applied by you on the target at the time of the cast. This damage increase lasts the full duration of Shadow Word: Gore.

